OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786358877
OL,3,CPolice investigate death of 90-year-
OL,4,Cold woman in 'horse and cart' collision
OL,6,FA 90 year-old woman has died in
OL,7,Fhospital following a road accident
OL,8,Finvolving a horse and cart on the Isle
OL,9,Fof Man.
OL,11,FAnne Kennedy Woods was in the cart on
OL,12,FKillane Road in Ballaugh just before
OL,13,F11am when the crash happened. She
OL,14,Fsuffered life threatening injuries and
OL,15,Fwas flown to the UK for treatment.
OL,17,FThe Isle of Man Constabulary said:
OL,18,F"She sadly succumbed to her injuries
OL,19,Fand died in hospital on the morning of
OL,20,FWednesday 5th August 2026."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
