OL,3,CPolice investigate death of 90-year-
OL,4,Cold woman in 'horse and cart' collision
OL,6,FIt added that her family have asked
OL,7,F"that their privacy is respected at
OL,8,Fthis difficult time".
OL,10,FPolice are appealing to eyewitnesses
OL,11,Fwho have not yet been in touch with
OL,12,Fthe police, to come forward. They also
OL,13,Fask the public to refrain from
OL,14,Fspeculation.
